}

docs {
  # Reject Invite
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `POST /api/invites/:id/reject`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Path Parameters)
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | id | UUID | ✅ | ID MemberProposal |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Undangan berhasil ditolak",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "status_invite": "rejected",
      "rejectedAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Success (already rejected)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Undangan sudah ditolak sebelumnya",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "status_invite": "rejected"
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Success (cannot reject accepted)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Tidak dapat menolak undangan yang sudah diterima",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "status_invite": "accepted"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | Undangan bukan untuk Anda |
  | 404 | Undangan tidak ditemukan |
}
